  `JXL_W44_201_FORCE_LEGACY_LARGE_BUCKETS=1`.
- **B_bytes (probe: bucket 3 only)**: gate skips bucket 3 (DCT32x32) only;
  bucket 6 (DCT32x16/DCT16x32) still admitted. Reached via
  `FORCE_LEGACY_LARGE_BUCKETS=1 JXL_W44_201_DISABLE_BUCKETS=3`.
- **C_bytes (PRODUCTION W44-201 fix)**: Zenjxl default — skip buckets
  3 AND 6 in custom-order cost-benefit admission. No env vars.

